Media tools and settings package

Tool schemas, descriptions, argument policy, settings composition and captions
are adapted from Sailry 5d0ac251:
plugins/builtin/media/agent/mod.rs
plugins/builtin/media/agent/generation.rs
plugins/builtin/media/desktop/messages.rs
plugins/builtin/media/desktop/settings/mod.rs
crates/node-runtime/src/files/media.rs
locales/en.yml and locales/zh-CN.yml

The tool Frame icon preserves the vector geometry of GPUI Kit b79f4ce:
crates/assets/assets/icons/frame.svg
Only the unused CSS class attribute and whitespace were removed. GPUI Kit's
Apache-2.0 license is included in LICENSE-APACHE.

Frozen model configuration, provider credentials, model execution, attachment
access, confined files, usage accounting and durable outcomes remain in Sailry
core. This package owns tool policy and composes the existing Kit settings UI.
